<title>RUSSIA: Russia prelim 1996 sugar beet harvest 14.9 mln T.</title>
<headline>Russia prelim 1996 sugar beet harvest 14.9 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's 1996 sugar beet harvest fell to 14.9 million tonnes, down from 1995's 18.3 million, according to preliminary figures released on Friday by the State Statistics Committee.  </p>
<p>The latest government forecast for 1996 sugar beet output had been 16.0 million tonnes.</p>
<p>--Alastair Macdonald, Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
